      "updated": 1788750300908,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C# 13        .NET 9      \nC# 12        .NET 8 (LTS)\nC# 11        .NET 7     \nC# 10        .NET 6",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C# 13        .NET 9      \nC# 12        .NET 8 (LTS)\nC# 11        .NET 7     \nC# 10        .NET 6",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "o-d_yjaRQX-cc27WSMS2B",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 954.36739881427,
      "y": 853.1132542140957,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2089510802,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1161833234,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788750227773,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "C# 版本默认对应的 .NET SDK / 目标框架核心特性/标志性更新C# 13.NET 9params 集合支持、改进 lock\n对象 (System.Threading.Lock)C# 12.NET 8 (LTS)主构造函数 (Primary Constructors)、集合表达式\n[]C# 11.NET 7原始字符串字面量 (\"\"\")、泛型数学接口支持C# 10.NET 6 (LTS)全局 using (global\nusing)、文件范围命名空间声明C# 9.0.NET 5顶级语句、Record 记录类型、Init-only 属性C# 8.0.NET\nCore 3.0 / 3.1可空引用类型 (Nullable)、Async Streams、默认接口方法C# 7.0 - 7.3.NET Core 1.0\n- 2.1 / .NET Framework 4.7+元组 (Tuples)、模式匹配、ref 局部变量与返回值C# 6.0.NET Framework\n4.6字符串插值 ($\"\")、Null 条件运算符 (?.)C# 5.0.NET Framework 4.5async / await 异步编程C#\n4.0.NET Framework 4.0dynamic 动态类型、命名和可选参数C# 3.0.NET Framework 3.5LINQ、Lambda 表\n达式、扩展方法、var 隐式类型C# 2.0.NET Framework 2.0泛型 (Generics)、匿名方法、可空值类型\n(int?)C# 1.0 / 1.2.NET Framework 1.0 / 1.1C# 语言诞生、委托与事件基础",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "C# 版本默认对应的 .NET SDK / 目标框架核心特性/标志性更新C# 13.NET 9params 集合支持、改进 lock 对象 (System.Threading.Lock)C# 12.NET 8 (LTS)主构造函数 (Primary Constructors)、集合表达式 []C# 11.NET 7原始字符串字面量 (\"\"\")、泛型数学接口支持C# 10.NET 6 (LTS)全局 using (global using)、文件范围命名空间声明C# 9.0.NET 5顶级语句、Record 记录类型、Init-only 属性C# 8.0.NET Core 3.0 / 3.1可空引用类型 (Nullable)、Async Streams、默认接口方法C# 7.0 - 7.3.NET Core 1.0 - 2.1 / .NET Framework 4.7+元组 (Tuples)、模式匹配、ref 局部变量与返回值C# 6.0.NET Framework 4.6字符串插值 ($\"\")、Null 条件运算符 (?.)C# 5.0.NET Framework 4.5async / await 异步编程C# 4.0.NET Framework 4.0dynamic 动态类型、命名和可选参数C# 3.0.NET Framework 3.5LINQ、Lambda 表达式、扩展方法、var 隐式类型C# 2.0.NET Framework 2.0泛型 (Generics)、匿名方法、可空值类型 (int?)C# 1.0 / 1.2.NET Framework 1.0 / 1.1C# 语言诞生、委托与事件基础",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
